      "created_at": "2020-11-20T01:42:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<div>This happened to me too, with Hunted Naturalist and VG Writhe among others against Chokepoint Ultimate. Threatening Stomp and Indomitable Force in play. I picked the cloak effect to take effect first, discarded a card, and then it applied a 3 HP attack on Writhe. I replayed multiple times, with the same thing happening (at one point I swear it calculated a -1 attack and applied it! Writhe's HP went up 1). Sorry, I didn't keep the log.</div>",
